# typed copy, failing to the other copy, and the read stands behind it, in the front. The rule on what may leave a loop is as it was: a read that relies on its bounds stays where its proof holds.
# The row's class and storage are then asked in the front by the code that asks them of any list from in front, and the turns read raw numbers.
